save wallet = 10
save last_choice = 0

howdy, pardner!

Would you like to play a game of chance?
- Yes
  Great! You have {wallet} coins in your wallet.
  Let's see if you can double your money!
  Pick a number between 1 and 5:
  - 1
    set last_choice = 1
  - 2
    set last_choice = 2
  - 3
    set last_choice = 3
  - 4
    set last_choice = 4
  - 5
    set last_choice = 5

  if last_choice >= 3
    You picked {last_choice}. Lucky you!
    You win 10 coins!
    set wallet = wallet + 10
  else
    You picked {last_choice}. Unlucky!
    You lose 5 coins.
    set wallet = wallet - 5
  You now have {wallet} coins in your wallet.
  Thanks for playing! See you soon, pardner!
- No
  Maybe next time, pardner!
